WEBVTT

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:15.500
Come on, come on.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.916
No. They couldn't...

00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:27.875
Kai, don't come this way.
They have a weapon! Stay away!

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:35.708
<i>Kai, don't come this way.</i>

00:00:35.791 --> 00:00:37.833
<i>They have a weapon!</i>

00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:41.083
Nya!

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.541
Hold on. I'm coming.

00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:29.000
Kai! I told you to stay away.

00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:31.666
Sending a distress signal
is a funny way of saying it.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.583
That wasn't me.

00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:37.791
It wasn't you?
Oh, I guess they want me!

00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:41.625
Not just you. They drew away the last
E-Pilot who could defend the ship.

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:49.833
Okay, so let's get rid of this thing.

00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:51.083
No, stop! You can't!

00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:54.000
There's Elemental Masters inside.
Against their will.

00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:55.666
We'll never stop it.

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:07.333
Kai, what are you doing?

00:02:13.041 --> 00:02:14.625
I kept it warm for you.

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.541
Save the Elementals.

00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:22.375
Kai, if you make it out of this,
promise me you'll walk away.

00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:27.041
We're not fighting demons
or monsters anymore.

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:29.291
It's people. Nations.

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:35.833
They call us warriors,
protectors, ninja.

00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:39.500
Drops of rain on a wildfire
that only spreads.

00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:45.500
What if we're really just embers,
sparking new conflict wherever we go?

00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:49.791
<i>If the world</i>
<i>is ever going to know peace...</i>

00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:54.625
<i>peace that lasts longer</i>
<i>than the change of seasons...</i>

00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:59.166
<i>someone has to stop</i>
<i>fanning the flames.</i>

